diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 40bb092..88bfa44 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -220,0 +221,12 @@ A missing dependency, authentication failure, unsupported backend, or version re
+When `FM_ACCOUNT_ROUTER` is set, account-profile selection is a separate local
+boundary below harness dispatch. `fm-spawn.sh` may change only `CODEX_HOME`
+inside `harness=codex`, or only `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` inside `harness=claude`;
+labels such as `codex1` and `claude1` are never harness identifiers. If current
+worker evidence proves a quota or credential stop, preserve its worktree and
+resolved harness, then use the ordinary `fm-control.sh <task-id> relaunch`
+lifecycle. The replacement spawn re-evaluates active profiles for that same
+provider. If selection refuses because capacity is stale, unknown, tied, or
+exhausted, report that same-provider blocker and stop rather than crossing to a
+different harness. A running CLI cannot change credential stores in place, so
+profile rotation occurs only at a spawn or controlled relaunch boundary.
+
